<title>USA: Volkswagen to again use Port of Wilmington.</title>
<headline>Volkswagen to again use Port of Wilmington.</headline>
<dateline>AUBURN HILLS, Mich. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Volkswagen AG's Volkswagen of America Inc, the importer of Audi and Volkswagen vehicles, said Friday it again would import vehicles through the Port of Wilmington, Del.</p>
<p>Volkswagen had closed a Wilmington facility last year in a streamlining move, but it said it determined that increased sales and new distribution methods required more capacity.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
